{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.NucleonBorromeanTopology","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.NucleonBorromeanTopology","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.HadronicMass"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.nucleon_borromean_topology","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.nucleon_borromean_topology","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/nucleon-borromean-topology.lean#L32-L48","doc":"**Nucleon Borromean topology — existence form.**\n\nA nucleon's topological data consists of a `QuarkFlavorFactor`\nencoding its three quark content together with the Borromean\nhyperbolic volume `vol_borromean` (external 3-link) and the\nHopf-link volume `vol_hopf_link` (internal pairwise binding).\nThe lemma packages the existence of a coherent datum: the Lake\nmodule's `proton_quarks` already realises one such instance,\nThe existence statement holds. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:nucleon-borromean-topology","label":"lem:nucleon-borromean-topology","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/nucleon-borromean-topology.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}